cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Wannier90 in your research, please cite the preferred-citation
  article below. Additional references (for versions 2.x of the code and for
  the underlying method) are listed in the README. The top-level authors below
  are the Wannier90 Developer Group; the full list of authors and contributors
  to the code is given in AUTHORS.md.
title: Wannier90
abstract: >-
  Wannier90 is an open-source code for generating maximally-localised
  generalised Wannier functions and using them to compute advanced electronic
  properties of materials with high efficiency and accuracy.
type: software
version: 4.0.3
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/wannier-developers/wannier90
url: https://www.wannier.org
